# Track only what the DSH iOS app needs to build and run:
#   dsh-ios/    app sources, rootfs recipe, tests, Makefile
#   ish-arm64/  the iSH-ARM64 emulator fork it embeds (with our fixes)
#   .github/    CI
#   site/       GitHub Pages project page
# Everything else in this workspace (analysis PDF, deepseek-harness checkout,
# iGhostty, scratch work dirs) is ignored.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/dsh-ios/
!/ish-arm64/
!/site/
!/README.md

# Generated artifacts
dsh-ios/build/
*.xcresult
ish-arm64/build-arm64-release/
ish-arm64/build/
ish-arm64/e2e_out/
ish-arm64/deps/build/
xcuserdata/
.DS_Store
